$CATEGORY: Vocabulary/HansenQuinn/4-ppm-02

::Q001::[markdown]εἰ:{
	~%-100%now#Incorrect. **νῦν** means “now” (Chapter 2).
	~%-100%would that#Incorrect. **εἴθε; εἰ γάρ** means “would that” (Chapter 7).
	~%-100%then#Incorrect. **οὖν** means “then” (Chapter 7).
	~%-100%and#Incorrect. **καί** means “and” (Chapter 1).
	~%100%if#Correct: **εἰ** → “if” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%but#Incorrect. **δέ** means “but” (Chapter 2).
	~%-100%since#Incorrect. **ἐπεί** means “since” (Chapter 3).
	~%-100%even#Incorrect. **καί** means “even” (Chapter 1).
}


::Q002::[markdown]wish:{
	~%-100%τάξω#Incorrect. **τάξω** is Principal Part 2 of **τάττω** “draw up (in battle)” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%πεπολίτευμαι#Incorrect. **πεπολίτευμαι** is Principal Part 5 of **πολῑτεύω** “live as a citizen” (Chapter 6).
	~%-100%τιμάω#Incorrect. **τιμάω** is Principal Part 1 of **τιμάω** “to honor” (Chapter 9).
	~%100%ἠθέληκα#Correct: **ἠθέληκα** is Principal Part 4 of **ἐθέλω** “wish” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%ἐχορεύθην#Incorrect. **ἐχορεύθην** is Principal Part 6 of **χορεύω** “dance” (Chapter 6).
	~%-100%κεκώλῡμαι#Incorrect. **κεκώλῡμαι** is Principal Part 5 of **κωλύω** “hinder” (Chapter 6).
	~%-100%κεκέλευσμαι#Incorrect. **κεκέλευσμαι** is Principal Part 5 of **κελεύω** “command” (Chapter 2).
}


::Q003::[markdown]τάξω:{
	~%50%draw up (in battle)#Correct: **τάξω** is Principal Part 2 of **τάττω** “draw up (in battle)” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%harm#Incorrect. **βλάπτω** is Principal Part 1 of **βλάπτω** “harm” (Chapter 5).
	~%-100%(passive) be governed#Incorrect. **πολῑτεύω** is Principal Part 1 of **πολῑτεύω** “(passive) be governed” (Chapter 6).
	~%-100%command (+ gen)#Incorrect. **ἄρχω** is Principal Part 1 of **ἄρχω** “command (+ gen)” (Chapter 5).
	~%50%arrange, order#Correct: **τάξω** is Principal Part 2 of **τάττω** “arrange, order” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%die#Incorrect. **τελευτάω** is Principal Part 1 of **τελευτάω** “die” (Chapter 10).
	~%-100%throw#Incorrect. **βάλλω** is Principal Part 1 of **βάλλω** “throw” (Chapter 11).
}


::Q004::[markdown]noble:{
	~%-100%δεινός, δεινή, δεινόν#Incorrect. **δεινός, δεινή, δεινόν** means “fearsome” (Chapter 6).
	~%-100%ἐχθρός, ἐχθρά, ἐχθρόν#Incorrect. **ἐχθρός, ἐχθρά, ἐχθρόν** means “hated” (Chapter 9).
	~%-100%ἀθάνατος, ἀθάνατον#Incorrect. **ἀθάνατος, ἀθάνατον** means “undying” (Chapter 5).
	~%-100%ἔμπειρος, ἔμπειρον#Incorrect. **ἔμπειρος, ἔμπειρον** means “experienced in (+ gen.)” (Chapter 9).
	~%100%εὐγενής, εὑγενές#Correct: **εὐγενής, εὑγενές** → “noble” (Chapter 10).
	~%-100%οὗτος αὕτη τοῦτο#Incorrect. **οὗτος αὕτη τοῦτο** means “this” (Chapter 9).
	~%-100%σώφρων, σῶφρον#Incorrect. **σώφρων, σῶφρον** means “prudent” (Chapter 10).
	~%-100%ἀνάξιος, ἀνάξιον#Incorrect. **ἀνάξιος, ἀνάξιον** means “unworthy of ( + gen)” (Chapter 4).
}


::Q005::[markdown]with:{
	~%100%μετά + gen.#Correct: **μετά + gen.** → “with” (Chapter 4).
	~%-100%παρά + acc#Incorrect. **παρά + acc** means “to the side of” (Chapter 2).
	~%-100%περί + gen#Incorrect. **περί + gen** means “concerning” (Chapter 3).
	~%-100%ἀντί + gen#Incorrect. **ἀντί + gen** means “instead of” (Chapter 3).
	~%-100%ὑπὸ + acc#Incorrect. **ὑπὸ + acc** means “under (with motion)” (Chapter 5).
	~%-100%περί + acc.#Incorrect. **περί + acc.** means “around” (Chapter 3).
	~%-100%παρά + dat#Incorrect. **παρά + dat** means “at the side of” (Chapter 2).
	~%-100%διά + acc#Incorrect. **διά + acc** means “on account of” (Chapter 3).
}


