	~%-100%market place#Incorrect. **ἀγορά, ἀγορᾶς, ἡ** means “market place” (Chapter 1).
	~%-100%purpose#Incorrect. **γνώμη, γνώμης, ἡ** means “purpose” (Chapter 6).
	~%-100%father#Incorrect. **πατήρ, πατρός, ὁ** means “father” (Chapter 10).
	~%100%day#Correct: **ἡμέρα, ἡμέρας, ἡ** → “day” (Chapter 4).
