	~%-100%3rd#Incorrect. ‘Perfect, Middle/Passive, Indicative, 1st person, Singular’ is the **5th Principal Part**, not the 3rd.
	~%100%5th#Correct: ‘Perfect, Middle/Passive, Indicative, 1st person, Singular’ is the **5th Principal Part**.
	~%-100%4th#Incorrect. ‘Perfect, Middle/Passive, Indicative, 1st person, Singular’ is the **5th Principal Part**, not the 4th.
}


